From 4e38c6620c0572930c655da3bddf0676bfe17f5d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RapidRAW Dev <dev@rapidraw.app>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 22:31:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] revert: restore editor interface to v1.8.29

Revert the 1.8.30 editor interface architecture changes:
- Remove SidePanelArea and PanelSwitcher components (drag-and-drop panel layout system)
- Remove DndContext/DragOverlay from App.tsx
- Restore EditorView, Editor, EditorToolbar, BottomBar, AndroidBottomNav to v1.8.29
- Restore useUIStore to v1.8.29 (remove panelLayout/activePanels/panelSwitcherPlacement)
- Restore AndroidBottomNav.test.tsx to v1.8.29
- Keep non-editor 1.8.30 features (library grouping, culling, etc.)
