From 210655381288a787d83c628429a6206e9f23e72a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RapidRAW Dev <dev@rapidraw.app>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 23:38:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix: comprehensive stability, performance, and Android
 optimization

Workflow fixes:
- Fix checksums.txt being overwritten by matrix jobs (use per-job filenames)
- Add keystore.properties to .gitignore (prevent credential leak)
- Fix release-verify running unnecessarily when version-sync-check fails

Android configuration fixes:
- Remove unused POST_NOTIFICATIONS permission (no notification implementation)
- Remove restrictive host="*" from intent-filter (improve file matching)
- Add requestLegacyExternalStorage for Android 9 compatibility
- Add external-media-path to FileProvider paths (prevent share_image crash)
- Clean up invalid proguard rules (org.tauri, bytedeco, tokenizers, NativeActivity)
- Remove dead strings from strings.xml (en + zh)
- Remove template colors from colors.xml

Rust backend stability fixes:
- Fix empty collection unwrap panics in portrait_processing.rs (face_regions)
- Fix empty collection unwrap panics in lens_correction.rs (tcas, vignettings)
- Fix contradictory exit cleanup in lib.rs (remove prevent_exit before hard exit,
  allow natural cleanup on RunEvent::Exit)

Frontend cleanup:
- Remove dead types from AppProperties.tsx (PanelRegion, SwitcherPlacement,
  WorkspaceState, workspace field)
